 ## 3.0.4
 
+-   **FIX**: Cache whether an element is or has a matching ancestor when matching the descendant combinator (`a b`) to
+    avoid time that grows with the depth of the document to the power of the number of combinators.
 -   **FIX**: Keep own and descendant text separate when combining `:-soup-contains()` and `:-soup-contains-own()`.
 -   **FIX**: Cache resolved directionality when matching `:dir()` to avoid quadratic time on deeply nested
     `dir="auto"` elements.
